 Dog Trainer &amp; Creator of the Dog Calming Code&#x2122;</strong></p></div></div><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id148364_0760ba-11 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top"><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column148364_9d5d82-ba"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column148364_680264-14"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><p class="kt-adv-heading148364_ac0380-1c wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading148364_ac0380-1c"><strong> </strong>With over 100,000 success stories worldwide, Dan is the creator of the <strong>Dog Calming Code&#x2122;</strong>&#8230; a simple, force-free method trusted by dog owners, trainers, and rescue groups to transform reactive, anxious, and out-of-control dogs.</p><p class="kt-adv-heading148364_1079b6-f8 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading148364_1079b6-f8"><strong>In this free webinar</strong>, he’ll show you why reactivity isn’t a training issue, <em>it’s a leadership one</em>, and exactly how to fix it with calm, lasting results.</p><p class="kt-adv-heading148364_f57360-73 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading148364_f57360-73"><strong>WARNING: </strong>Space is limited&#8230; these trainings always fill up because what Dan is delivering is lightyears ahead of anything any other dog trainer will share with you… <em>and this is for FREE!</em></p></div></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column148364_5ac8eb-93"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><figure class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image148364_69591a-77"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="450" height="466" src="https://theonlinedogtrainer.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Dan-and-Jack-Rego-Header-image-450.webp" alt="" class="kb-img wp-image-148758" srcset="https://theonlinedogtrainer.com/wp-